  <item>
    <title>vol 26. 暴走120km探索俄罗斯双城圣彼得堡与莫斯科（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674a9799c3b2a2f3348c83da</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674a9799c3b2a2f3348c83da</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Nov 2024 04:49:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello，好久不见呀！我们终于又更新啦～（努力变成一档非年更播客！</span></p><span></span><p><span>两位主播最近去俄罗斯深度游了十天，加起来一共走了120公里。每天两眼一睁就是走，不是city walk，就是在逛博物馆、宫殿和教堂，但是逛不完，根本逛不完，感觉接受了超饱和的艺术熏陶和文化洗礼。同时这次我们也有许多神奇的体验，比如靶场打枪、芭蕾舞剧、看开桥等等。我们也会分享一些大家可能关心的问题，比如现在去俄罗斯是否安全，语言和支付问题如何解决，实用性满满。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期为俄罗斯旅行下集，欢迎收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎听友+vx: bzoe0514，交个朋友吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 喀山大教堂和圣以撒大教堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a> 叶卡捷琳娜宫不止有宫殿，还有好看的园林</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a> 坐拥喷泉小金人和惬意芬兰湾的彼得大帝夏宫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1164">19:24</a> 一定不能错过的圣彼得堡开桥仪式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">22:01</a> 来到首都莫斯科继续逛艺术之普希金艺术馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> 克里姆林宫偶遇普京车队？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2189">36:29</a> 极尽奢华到叹为观止的钻石库</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a> 在CCCP前苏联二手店淘宝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2723">45:23</a> 关于语言、吃饭、赶火车那些窘迫的事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 在俄罗斯如何换钱最省心最方便？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也对这些话题感兴趣，不要错过本期节目！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5m9SqEkkWciPgsPzflz3kTcu7M.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh87odT4WBYIU7btBG5L3fEs4Qk-.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuGs9xq0Km_rN0DfGq0tXYK2r3SV.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiGbMZFo1pGeCBuNVXpZpCYTGGei.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhVEZRBIxaqbdeT_ejrE5g4E20Qp.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlUe72B1bo6Txa7mwqXwJ9Zx3nGc.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtDL01AkSNtXPjX2vvQr6fQBpenn.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqntA6HJmvmUqQHx_JcGnUZyEGUy.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls_VTM3aLadACnCBUH2s0fjvJGtz.m4a" length="82417632" type="audio/mp4"/>
