    <guid isPermaLink="false">671d17aa44ae79002c41e8eb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 26 Oct 2024 16:24:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello，好久不见呀！我们终于又更新啦～（努力变成一档非年更播客！</span></p><span></span><p><span>两位主播最近去俄罗斯深度游了十天，加起来一共走了120公里。每天两眼一睁就是走，不是city walk，就是在逛博物馆、宫殿和教堂，但是逛不完，根本逛不完，感觉接受了超饱和的艺术熏陶和文化洗礼。同时这次我们也有许多神奇的体验，比如靶场打枪、芭蕾舞剧、看开桥等等。我们也会分享一些大家可能关心的问题，比如现在去俄罗斯是否安全，语言和支付问题如何解决，实用性满满。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期为俄罗斯旅行的上集，下集也即将上线，敬请期待！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎听友+vx: bzoe0514，交个朋友吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 初印象之彪悍的俄罗斯民风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 圣彼得堡和莫斯科的城市性格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 现在去俄罗斯是否安全？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 从门说起，推开历史的厚重感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> 一张地铁票就能膜拜的俄式美学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">26:42</a> 酷毙了的实弹射击体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2269">37:49</a> 观看一场极富盛名的皇家芭蕾舞剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2991">49:51</a> 涅瓦河游船与梦幻天空</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3422">57:02</a> 在冬宫博物馆及其新馆，对艺术有了新的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也对这些话题感兴趣，不要错过本期节目！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fik75y_Y98MaXjUv-JRdLh-xLd9l.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlIBfOUvhv9pFBvKEEMTm5FdQAIT.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsdrh_E4ttc-qseEqdngdhfb0FJB.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmPAgXBI2jqFcf1NYUtZpHwlrV94.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqw0hkgpMlEUahHmhuqIplU07wqg.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsV90KaR5CblzN6TBDsaVINqbtny.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpChS1UP8e7NJEyXBe9EPey-L3NQ.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm7X0LlXWm__046VIW_N3fFSQ7T_.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
