  <item>
    <title>vol.21 观《长安三万里》有感：长大之后，我终于读懂了李白的诗和人！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d88c8c80c9ec4c5f2018fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d88c8c80c9ec4c5f2018fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Aug 2023 07:55:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目分享《长安三万里》观后感，含大量剧透。</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> </span></strong><span>为什么说这是一部大人向的动画片？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">04:04</a></span></strong><span> 《长安三万里》剧情简介</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a></span></strong><span> 潇洒随性、才华横溢、自负狂妄的大诗人李白</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a></span></strong><span> 朴实勤奋、稳重内敛、政治敏感的普通人高适</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a></span></strong><span> 全片最华丽的剧情名场面：将进酒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2302">38:22</a> 从人物形象到分镜，考究细节的美术展现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2931">48:51</a> “诗在，书在，长安就在”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3342">55:42</a> 从高适的视角讲述李白和长安，是一个很妙的叙事视角</span></p><p><span>欢迎听友+vx: bzoe0514，交个朋友吧～</span></p><p><span>如果你也对这些话题感兴趣，不要错过本期节目！</span></p>]]></description>
