    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>近两年，露营在年轻族群中越来越火。两位主播也赶了个晚晚的时髦，跟风体验并且爱上了这项户外活动。本期节目将分享作为露营入门级选手，我们的感受和心得。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a></span></strong><span> 露营和野餐的区别</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a></span></strong><span> 露营地点选址需要考虑的因素</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a></span></strong><span> 基础装备使用体验</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a></span></strong><span> 充满乐趣的现场烹饪</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2484">41:24</a></span></strong><span> 非必要但回头率爆表的自制装备</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2603">43:23</a></span></strong><span> 给入门级露营玩家的建议</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2951">49:11</a></span></strong><span> 还有哪些露营体验有待挖掘</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也对这些话题感兴趣，不要错过本期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>P.S. 新手主播刚上路，多有不足之处～ 如果你对我们的节目有任何建议和想法，都欢迎在评论区留言喔！</span></p>]]></description>
